preConditionHook:
// Brooks's "oo" pattern: an outside bar followed by a LARGER outside bar
// that engulfs it -- a two-bar expanding triangle. Four fixed-offset price
// comparisons, no window and no state, so nothing to precompute; the whole
// rule is the condition below.
//
// EL, lowercase as the feature register writes it:
//   h[1] > h[2] and l[1] < l[2] and h > h[1] and l < l[1]
// STRICT on all four, as the source writes it -- the inclusive boundary is
// InsideBarInclusive's convention, not this one, and a bar that merely ties
// the prior extreme has not engulfed it.
//
// The source's extra (h - l) > (h[1] - l[1]) term is implied by the
// last two comparisons and is dropped as redundant.
//
// Direction comes from the breakout of the pattern, so both sides are
// identical text.
